# 统一换行：仓库里存 LF，检出时按平台/类型还原
* text=auto

# Windows 脚本必须 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe / PowerShell 5.1 解析出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.exe binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# 文本
*.js text
*.css text
*.html text
*.json text
*.svg text
*.md text
*.cs text
*.manifest text
